inline node #pragma doc 1st order filter 
            At the initialization Output_R = Init 
            After initialization Output_R = K1*Input(k)-k2*Output_R(k-1) where k stands for the current cycle. #end Filter1stOrderLoop (F1OL_Input: 'T;
                                                                                                                                        K1: 'T;
                                                                                                                                        K2: 'T;
